TITLE:: RCLoopBuffer
summary:: A live input loop capture
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCOrgnsmPatterns, Classes/RCSynthDefs

DESCRIPTION::
Allocates a buffer of strong::loopBeats:: × strong::maxTempoDrop:: beats at the current tempo, starts a code::write_buffer_<n>chan:: synth recording from code::song.inChanArray[inChanIdx]:: and a clock-locked routine that retriggers the record head every loop. If the tempo later drops by more than the margin, a warning is posted once and the recording is truncated. Registered under its key in the song; freed by the song's code::clearAll::.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: new
argument:: song
argument:: key
argument:: loopBeats
argument:: inChanIdx
argument:: numChannels
argument:: layerKey
argument:: maxTempoDrop
METHOD:: framesFor

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: buffer
METHOD:: synth
METHOD:: numFramesPerLoop
METHOD:: fits
METHOD:: free
